    <mxCell id="c49" value="18. access + id + refresh tokens — iss = https://gw/{tenant}, signed with the TENANT key" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="c48"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" width="430" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="c50" value="Zero-trust: no code or token can be issued while the second factor is pending — MfaPendingGateFilter blocks /oauth2/authorize at the protocol chain, so a password-only session cannot mint tokens by navigating directly. Tokens carry the per-tenant issuer and are signed with the tenant&#x27;s own key; resource servers verify signature + issuer allowlist + scope on every call." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacing=4;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1076" width="1360" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
